OL,3,AWilliam Chapman identified as man
OL,4,Akilled in tiger attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA force spokesperson said his family
OL,7,Fwas aware and was being supported by
OL,8,Fspecialist officers. The park was
OL,9,Fevacuated after the incident and
OL,10,Fremains closed as investigations
OL,11,Fcontinue.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
