OL,3,ABreaking Bad actor RJ Mitte dies aged
OL,4,A34
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS actor RJ Mitte, best known for his
OL,7,Frole as the defiant son of drug kingpin
OL,8,FWalter White in the drama series
OL,9,FBreaking Bad, has died at the age of
OL,10,F34.
OL,12,F"It is with profound sadness that we
OL,13,Fshare the tragic passing of beloved
OL,14,Factor, philanthropist, and passionate
OL,15,Fdisability rights advocate RJ Mitte,"
OL,16,Fhis representative told the BBC.
OL,18,FMitte died in Brownsvillle, Texas, on
OL,19,FMonday. His publicist confirmed that he
OL,20,Ftook his own life.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
