OL,3,AOne dead and several hurt after
OL,4,Arollercoaster incident at Six Flags
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne person has died and several others
OL,7,Fwere injured after an incident on a
OL,8,Frollercoaster at an amusement park in
OL,9,Fthe state of Georgia.
OL,11,FThe Cobb County Police Department said
OL,12,Fit was investigating the fatality at
OL,13,FSix Flags Over Georgia, about 15 miles
OL,14,F(24km) from Atlanta, according to the
OL,15,FBBC's news partner CBS News.
OL,17,FPolice did not specify which ride was
OL,18,Finvolved, but aerial footage from news
OL,19,Fhelicopters showed the Goliath
OL,20,Frollercoaster stopped midway, with
OL,21,Friders being helped off by workers.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
